    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nnew\n\n### Description\n\nHi! It would be nice to have something similar to [Twilight](https://github.com/folke/twilight.nvim).\nI love the idea of having small modules, keeping nvim with just the essential, and since twilight has been discontinued",
